msgstr ""

#: ../../operations/budgets.rst:40
msgid "Budget Monitoring"
msgstr "Monitoramento de Orçamento"

#: ../../operations/budgets.rst:42
msgid ""
"As the year (or years) goes on, existing Budgets can be reviewed to "
"compare actual spend against the budgeted amount. To access the Budget "
"detail, navigate to |OpeCosBud| and select the desired Budget. The "
"reported actual amount for a given month will be the same as the total "
"cost reported for the month on the Invoice with the same scoping (for the"
" current month, projected cost is used). Depending on the Cloud type, "
"this figure can be pulled from a public clouds live costing API (such as "
"with AWS, Azure, or GCP Clouds) or from the |morpheus| in-built cost "
"metering for private clouds (like VMware)."
msgstr "Conforme o ano (ou anos) avança, Orçamentos existentes podem ser revisados para comparar o gasto real com o valor orçado. Para acessar o detalhe do Orçamento, navegue até |OpeCosBud|"

